{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And Abraham said.</b> Here he did not take permission from her but against her will, without her consent, because she had already been taken to the house of Pharaoh on account of this." "<b>Of Sarah his wife.</b> Concerning Sarah his wife — as in ״אֶל הִלָּקַח אֲרוֹן״ and ״וְאֶל מוֹת חָמִיהָ״ (1 Samuel 4) — both in the sense of עַל."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:36.226346073Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}